    "name": "Side pod (USB)",
    "description": "Vape box side pod driven over USB (VapePodUSB, glider-vapepod plugin): pump on, a 3 s puff at 50 %, then all off. Port left blank so GLIDER finds the XIAO.",
    "author": "",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "created_at": "2026-11-13T12:02:44.986462",
    "modified_at": "2026-11-13T12:02:44.986462",
